== what this proves ==
status.tracked_releases must count the release-tracked set the inventory
serves (<state>/releases.json), not the daemon's own notification memory
(<state>/release-registry.json). The two documents below are written so
that the answer differs: two tracked packages, zero notifications.

== state directory ==
total 8
drwx------ 1 tension_atoi tension_atoi  46 Oct 28 13:00 journal
-rw-r--r-- 1 tension_atoi tension_atoi  27 Oct 28 13:00 release-registry.json
-rw-r--r-- 1 tension_atoi tension_atoi 434 Oct 28 13:00 releases.json

